{"stormtrooper5(eng)" "This team of anti-tank rocket-launcher infantrymen is armed with a PIAT and they are trained to destroy tanks in close combat by launching armor-piercing rounds. They are capable of destroying even the heaviest armored vehicles -- provided they can find a weakness to exploit. Beware of the armored skirts on some vehicles, as they greatly reduce the effectiveness of these shaped-charge rounds."}
